  "notes": "{叫|さけ}ぶ means to shout, yell, or cry out loudly.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{大声|おおごえ}→大声：09592_oogoe⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{叫|さけ}ぶ: to shout loudly\n- ⟦{助|たす}けて→助ける：00895_tasukeru⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{叫|さけ}ぶ: to cry for help\n- {叫|さけ}び⟦{声|ごえ}→声：02207_koe⟧: a shout, scream\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{怒鳴|どな}る→怒鳴る：05340_donaru⟧: to yell (angrily, at someone)\n- ⟦わめく→喚く：05345_wameku⟧: to scream, cry out wildly\n- ⟦{悲鳴|ひめい}→悲鳴：12621_himei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{上|あ}げる→上げる：02443_ageru⟧: to let out a scream\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {叫|さけ}び: a shout, cry (noun form)",
